source.text:
\begin{defn}
A function $g \colon B \to A$ is an \emph{inverse} of a function $f
\colon A \to B$ if $f(g(y)) = y$ and $g(f(x)) = x$ for all $x \in A$
and $y \in B$.
\end{defn}

